soft YaHei UI&#x22;, &#x22;Microsoft YaHei&#x22;, Arial, sans-serif;line-height: 1.6;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;font-weight: bold;\">无需重写代码，让既有资产无缝延续</span></span></span></p></li></ul><p style=\"margin-bottom: 24px;margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;\"><span><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, &#x22;PingFang SC&#x22;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &#x22;Helvetica Neue&#x22;, &#x22;Hiragino Sans GB&#x22;, &#x22;Microsoft YaHei UI&#x22;, &#x22;Microsoft YaHei&#x22;, Arial, sans-serif;line-height: 1.6;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\">T-Head SAIL兼容主流AI生态，主流模型即开即用，算子库完整对标，主流编程模型高度兼容。开发者过去积累的经验、代码、调优技巧，在 T-Head SAIL上都能直接复用，业务迁移仅需极少量代码适配修改、平滑顺畅。</span></span></span></p><ul style=\"margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;\" class=\"\"><li style=\"font-weight:bold;\"><p style=\"margin-bottom: 24px;\"><span><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, &#x22;PingFang SC&#x22;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &#x22;Helvetica Neue&#x22;, &#x22;Hiragino Sans GB&#x22;, &#x22;Microsoft YaHei UI&#x22;, &#x22;Microsoft YaHei&#x22;, Arial, sans-serif;line-height: 1.6;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;font-weight: bold;\">无需等待适配，与前沿生态同频演进</span></span></span></p></li></ul><p style=\"margin-bottom: 24px;margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;\"><span><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, &#x22;PingFang SC&#x22;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &#x22;Helvetica Neue&#x22;, &#x22;Hiragino Sans GB&#x22;, &#x22;Microsoft YaHei UI&#x22;, &#x22;Microsoft YaHei&#x22;, Arial, sans-serif;line-height: 1.6;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\">AI技术迭代日新月异，平头哥自研推理引擎提供开箱即用的生产级性能，同时T-Head SAIL已完善建立与